{% set zh = route.locale == 'zh' %}
<header class="world-intro">
  <div>
    <p class="world-intro__eyebrow">{% if zh %}Leo Chai 的像素庭院{% else %}A pixel courtyard by Leo Chai{% endif %}</p>
    <h1>{{ route.title }}</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="world-intro__hello">{% if zh %}一方花园，一间工坊。<br>忙完了，就一起坐下来吧。{% else %}A little garden. A busy workshop.<br>Come sit for a while.{% endif %}</p>
</header>

<section class="world" id="live" aria-label="{% if zh %}庭院场景与回放{% else %}Courtyard scene and replay{% endif %}" data-world data-locale="{{ route.locale }}" data-scene="{{ '/world/scene.json' | url }}" data-trace="{{ '/world/trace.json' | url }}">
  <figure>
    <div class="world__view">
      <img class="world__poster" src="/world/poster.png" width="512" height="320" fetchpriority="high" alt="{% if zh %}溪水环绕的像素庭院：左侧是花园和工坊，右侧是厨房，三位居民聚在摆好午餐的餐桌旁。{% else %}A pixel courtyard beside a creek: garden and workshop to the left, kitchen to the right, and three residents gathered around a table set for lunch.{% endif %}">
      <canvas class="world__canvas" width="512" height="320" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <p class="world__fallback" data-asset-error hidden>{% if zh %}场景图片未能加载。下方的三个片段仍可阅读。{% else %}The courtyard image could not load. Its three story moments are still available below.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="world__caption"><strong>{% if zh %}庭院里的午后{% else %}An afternoon in the courtyard{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if zh %}示意场景 · 内置示例{% else %}Illustration · Bundled fixture{% endif %}</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="world__controls" data-controls hidden>
    <button class="world__button world__button--play" type="button" data-play><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 5 11 7-11 7Z"/></svg><span data-play-label>{% if zh %}播放这个午后{% else %}Play the afternoon{% endif %}</span></button>
    <button class="world__button" type="button" data-replay>{% if zh %}重播{% else %}Replay{% endif %}</button>
    <button class="world__button" type="button" data-step>{% if zh %}下一步{% else %}Next moment{% endif %}</button>
    <label class="world__scrub"><span class="world-visually-hidden">{% if zh %}回放进度{% else %}Replay progress{% endif %}</span><input type="range" min="0" max="40000" step="100" value="40000" data-seek><span class="world__time" data-time>0:40 / 0:40</span></label>
  </div>
  <div class="world__observation" data-observation>
    <p class="world__observation-title" data-event-caption>{{ world.completed.caption[route.locale] }}</p>
    <p class="world__observation-detail" data-event-observation>{{ world.completed.observation.text[route.locale] }}</p>
  </div>
  <p class="world-visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-announcement></p>
  <noscript><p>{% if zh %}这是完成后的静态场景。下方按顺序展示三个片段。{% else %}This is the completed still. Follow the three moments below.{% endif %}</p></noscript>
</section>

<section class="world-story" aria-labelledby="world-story-title">
  <div class="world-story__heading"><h2 id="world-story-title">{% if zh %}小事，慢慢连在一起{% else %}Small things, coming together{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if zh %}三位虚构的成年居民，共度一个午后。{% else %}Three fictional adult residents. One shared afternoon.{% endif %}</p></div>
  <ol class="world-story__steps">
    {% for still in world.stills %}
    <li><div class="world-story__image"><img src="/world/still-{{ loop.index }}.png" width="512" height="320" loading="lazy" alt="{{ still.title[route.locale] }}"></div><h3>{{ still.title[route.locale] }}</h3><p>{{ still.body[route.locale] }}</p></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<details class="world-details">
  <summary>{% if zh %}这个世界是怎样做的{% else %}A little about this world{% endif %}</summary>
  <div class="world-details__body">
    <p>{% if zh %}<strong>一个用来观看的小场景。</strong> 画面与回放使用同一个内置示例。动作、文字与路线均经过编排，不是实时运行记录，也不代表角色的真实思考或私人记忆。没有后台服务、模型调用或声音。{% else %}<strong>A little scene to watch.</strong> The stills and replay use the same bundled fixture. Its actions, words, and routes are authored, not a captured live run or a claim about actual cognition or private memory. There is no backend, model inference, or audio.{% endif %}</p>
    <p>{{ world.trace.presentation.note[route.locale] }} {% if zh %}拖动进度条，可查看任意时刻；关闭 JavaScript 时仍可阅读静态场景。{% else %}Seek to any moment; the completed scene and numbered story also work without JavaScript.{% endif %}</p>
    <p>{% if zh %}<strong>画作来源。</strong> 场景使用 <a href="https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-town">Kenney Tiny Town</a>、<a href="https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-farm">Tiny Farm</a> 与 <a href="https://merchant-shade.itch.io/16x16-puny-characters">Shade Puny Characters</a> 的 CC0 素材，另加原创编排与修改。{% else %}<strong>Art credits.</strong> Built with CC0 art from <a href="https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-town">Kenney Tiny Town</a>, <a href="https://kenney.nl/assets/tiny-farm">Tiny Farm</a>, and <a href="https://merchant-shade.itch.io/16x16-puny-characters">Shade Puny Characters</a>, with original composition and edits.{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</details>
